{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01N9ygYdmTDaA7X3SbXchPJQ","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t[\n2\t  {\n3\t    \"name\": \"Qwen DocRED FT + OntoCoDec constrained eval\",\n4\t    \"description\": \"Full S1 constrained decoding (grammar+semantic) on Qwen3-8B fine-tuned with LoRA on DocRED training set. Completes the 2×2 composability matrix (base/FT × unconstrained/constrained) for Qwen on DocRED. Baseline: FT unconstrained DR=0.76%, RV=0.27%, ET=0%, CF=0.12%, R-F1=40.86%, E-F1=82.15%, parse_fail=7.11%.\\n\",\n5\t    \"results\": {\n6\t      \"DR_pct\": 0.32,\n7\t      \"RV_pct\": 0.0,\n8\t      \"ET_pct\": 0.0,\n9\t      \"CF_pct\": 1.5,\n10\t      \"R_F1\": 40.35,\n11\t      \"R_precision\": 36.05,\n12\t      \"R_recall\": 45.8,\n13\t      \"E_F1\": 81.9,\n14\t      \"E_precision\": 85.2,\n15\t      \"E_recall\": 78.85,\n16\t      \"parse_fail_rate_pct\": 9.2,\n17\t      \"total_entities_pred\": \"~18050\",\n18\t      \"total_relations_pred\": \"~15800\",\n19\t      \"R_F1_delta_pp\": -0.51,\n20\t      \"E_F1_delta_pp\": -0.25,\n21\t      \"DR_reduction_from_ft_unconstrained_pct\": -57.9,\n22\t      \"CF_increase_from_ft_unconstrained_pp\": 1.38\n23\t    },\n24\t    \"tables\": [\n25\t      {\n26\t        \"name\": \"Table: Qwen DocRED 2×2 Composability Matrix\",\n27\t        \"content\": \"| Config              | DR%   | RV%   | ET%  | CF%   | R-F1   | E-F1   |\\n|---------------------|-------|-------|------|-------|--------|--------|\\n| Zero-shot unconst.  | 18.46 | 29.66 | 2.48 | 0.10  |  7.74  | 58.15  |\\n| Zero-shot full_s1   | 10.21 |  0.03 | 0.00 | 2.57  |  8.23  | 59.37  |\\n| FT unconstrained    |  0.76 |  0.27 | 0.00 | 0.12  | 40.86  | 82.15  |\\n| FT full_s1          |  0.32 |  0.00 | 0.00 | 1.50  | 40.35  | 81.90  |\\n\"\n28\t      },\n29\t      {\n30\t        \"name\": \"Table: Qwen DocRED FT+constrained per-relation DR (top violators)\",\n31\t        \"content\": \"| Relation                   | τ     | FT-unconst DR% | FT-const DR% | Δ       |\\n|----------------------------|-------|----------------|--------------|---------|\\n| P31_instance_of            | 0.98  | 1.8            | 0.9          | -0.9pp  |\\n| P1001_applies_to_jurisd.   | 0.95  | 1.2            | 0.4          | -0.8pp  |\\n| P710_participant           | 0.92  | 0.5            | 0.1          | -0.4pp  |\\n| Used-for (大部分)           | <0.5  | 0.0            | 0.0          | 0       |\\n\"\n32\t      }\n33\t    ],\n34\t    \"figures\": [],\n35\t    \"analysis\": \"Qwen DocRED FT+constrained结果在median tier下支持calibrated composability claim： FT is the primary mechanism (DR↓96%), OntoCoDec provides marginal but real additional reduction (0.76→0.32, ↓58%). R-F1 cost -0.51pp is the price of this guarantee, acceptable for compliance-critical applications. 与SciERC FT+constrained（DR=0%, R-F1=-0.09pp）的差距归因于ontology complexity: DocRED τ̄=0.842导致高fallback率， SciERC τ̄=0.333几乎不触发fallback。这不是方法局限而是可量化的tightness效应—— paper §5.4应报告fallback率差异作为解释。CF 1.5%与SciERC FT（1.18%）同量级， 确认FT大幅缓解CF问题（vs零代码CF=2.57%）。\\n论文framing调整：§5.4从\\\"FT+OntoCoDec = zero cost\\\"改为\\\"FT+OntoCoDec = negligible cost (R-F1 -0.5pp) with guaranteed DR reduction below 0.5%\\\"。Abstract中\\\"zero F1 cost\\\" 改为\\\"negligible F1 cost in the FT regime\\\"。\\n\\n\\nDR 0.76%→0.32%: FT已将DR从18.46%削减至0.76%（↓96%），残余主要集中在tight-constraint 关系（如P31_instance_of τ=0.98, P1001_applies_to_jurisdiction τ=0.95）。OntoCoDec semantic层可进一步消除部分残余，但DocRED τ̄=0.842导致大量token位置触发 grammar-first fallback（零代码DocRED full_s1约57次/doc）。FT模型fallback频率略低 （模型输出更规范，减少空集交集），但仍显著高于SciERC。残余0.32%来自：(1) fallback 退化到grammar-only的token位置上，模型生成了合法关系名但违规的domain/range组合； (2) FT模型在极少数tight-constraint关系上的latent DR violation（FT学到了常见pattern 但未完全覆盖罕见的合法entity-type对）。相比SciERC FT+constrained的DR=0.0%（Qwen）， DocRED的非零残余反映了ontology complexity对constraint coverage的系统性影响。\\nRV/ET→0%: Grammar层确保——与FT无关，和零代码行为一致。\\nR-F1 40.86→40.35（-0.51pp）: FT模型RV baseline仅0.27%（vs零代码29.66%），grammar层 几乎无precision提升空间（零代码时grammar消除OOV FP是F1提升的唯一来源）。同时semantic 层的logit masking在well-calibrated模型上产生轻微质量损失：FT模型的type assignment已高度 准确，semantic mask偶尔会阻止模型的正确首选token，迫使其选择次优但合法的替代——这在 SciERC上影响极小（-0.09pp），但DocRED 96个关系×高tightness意味着更多masking事件累积 为可测量的F1下降。Recall略降（constraint偶尔导致relation slot生成次优triple）， precision略降（少量新引入的CF violation对应的triple被checker计为violation但all_set 评测仍计入FP）。-0.51pp在统计上可能仅marginal significant（bootstrap p~0.03-0.08）， 是\\\"可接受的composability税\\\"而非方法缺陷。\\nCF 0.12%→1.5%: Semantic层引入entity-vs-relation type drift（与零代码机制相同）， 但FT模型已内化entity type conventions，CF远低于零代码（零代码Qwen DocRED CF=2.57%）。 SciERC FT CF=1.18%是参考锚点；DocRED因96关系×高tightness导致更多semantic enforcement 事件，CF略高于SciERC FT但远低于零代码。主要冲突模式预测：location↔country, organization↔political_party等DocRED type system边界模糊区。\\nParse fail 7.11%→9.2%（+2.1pp）: Qwen FT在DocRED上unconstrained已有较高parse failure （7.11%, 71/998 samples）。Constrained decoding的grammar enforcement在长文档上增加 generation复杂度，导致部分样本超时或生成中断。增幅与零代码（12/998→11/998，几乎不变） 不同，因为FT模型生成更长、更详细的输出（平均triple数~16-17per doc），constraint enforcement的累积overhead更大。\\n\"\n36\t  },\n37\t  {\n38\t    \"name\": \"Llama DocRED FT + OntoCoDec constrained eval\",\n39\t    \"description\": \"Full S1 constrained decoding (grammar+semantic) on Llama-3.1-8B fine-tuned with LoRA on DocRED training set. Completes the 2×2 composability matrix for Llama on DocRED. Baseline: FT unconstrained DR=0.49%, RV=0.15%, ET=0%, R-F1=43.72%, E-F1=83.93%, parse_fail=2.3%.\\n\",\n40\t    \"results\": {\n41\t      \"DR_pct\": 0.15,\n42\t      \"RV_pct\": 0.0,\n43\t      \"ET_pct\": 0.0,\n44\t      \"CF_pct\": 2.0,\n45\t      \"R_F1\": 43.42,\n46\t      \"R_precision\": 38.4,\n47\t      \"R_recall\": 50.1,\n48\t      \"E_F1\": 83.55,\n49\t      \"E_precision\": 84.6,\n50\t      \"E_recall\": 82.52,\n51\t      \"parse_fail_rate_pct\": 3.8,\n52\t      \"total_entities_pred\": \"~19050\",\n53\t      \"total_relations_pred\": \"~16100\",\n54\t      \"R_F1_delta_pp\": -0.3,\n55\t      \"E_F1_delta_pp\": -0.38,\n56\t      \"DR_reduction_from_ft_unconstrained_pct\": -69.4,\n57\t      \"CF_increase_from_ft_unconstrained_pp\": \"~2.0\"\n58\t    },\n59\t    \"tables\": [\n60\t      {\n61\t        \"name\": \"Table: Llama DocRED 2×2 Composability Matrix\",\n62\t        \"content\": \"| Config              | DR%   | RV%   | ET%  | CF%   | R-F1   | E-F1   |\\n|---------------------|-------|-------|------|-------|--------|--------|\\n| Zero-shot unconst.  | 26.07 | 16.03 | 0.13 | 0.17  |  5.98  | 55.65  |\\n| Zero-shot full_s1   |  2.55 |  0.00 | 0.00 | 12.02 |  6.27  | 55.01  |\\n| FT unconstrained    |  0.49 |  0.15 | 0.00 | ~0    | 43.72  | 83.93  |\\n| FT full_s1          |  0.15 |  0.00 | 0.00 | 2.00  | 43.42  | 83.55  |\\n\"\n63\t      },\n64\t      {\n65\t        \"name\": \"Table: Llama DocRED FT+constrained per-relation DR (top violators)\",\n66\t        \"content\": \"| Relation                   | τ     | FT-unconst DR% | FT-const DR% | Δ       |\\n|----------------------------|-------|----------------|--------------|---------|\\n| P31_instance_of            | 0.98  | 1.0            | 0.3          | -0.7pp  |\\n| P1001_applies_to_jurisd.   | 0.95  | 0.6            | 0.1          | -0.5pp  |\\n| Others (τ<0.9)             | <0.9  | ~0.0           | 0.0          | 0       |\\n\"\n67\t      }\n68\t    ],\n69\t    \"figures\": [],\n70\t    \"analysis\": \"Llama DocRED FT+constrained在median tier下表现略优于Qwen：DR更低（0.15% vs 0.32%）， R-F1损失更小（-0.30pp vs -0.51pp），parse failure更低（3.8% vs 9.2%）。但CF更高 （2.0% vs 1.5%），延续了Llama在DocRED上CF偏高的系统性pattern。\\n跨模型composability claim在median tier下仍然成立但需要nuance：两个模型都实现了 DR<0.5%（远低于零代码的10-26%），R-F1代价均<1pp，确认FT+OntoCoDec是robust的 composable pipeline。但R-F1不再是\\\"zero cost\\\"——需要修改为\\\"minimal cost\\\"。\\n\\n\\nDR 0.49%→0.15%: Llama FT baseline DR已极低（0.49%），低于Qwen FT（0.76%）。 两个因素解释Llama更低的残余：(1) Llama在DocRED上zero-shot RV baseline较低 （16.03% vs Qwen 29.66%），FT后RV更接近零（0.15%），grammar层处理更少OOV→ semantic层获得更干净的输入→更少fallback事件；(2) Llama FT在SciERC上constrained DR=0.09%（vs Qwen 0.0%），显示两模型在低DR区间差异微小。DocRED残余0.15%来自 极少数high-tightness关系（P31 τ=0.98等），这些关系的constraint空间极窄，FT 无法完全学习所有合法pair，OntoCoDec在fallback区域也无法覆盖。\\nR-F1 43.72→43.42（-0.30pp）: Llama在SciERC FT+constrained上实现+0.02pp（中性）， 但DocRED的高tightness增加constraint overhead。-0.30pp比Qwen（-0.51pp）更小， 与两模型在零代码上的pattern一致：Llama对constraint decoding更robust（零代码 DocRED R-F1 Llama +0.29pp vs Qwen +0.50pp，注意Qwen实际是从更低基线提升更多， 而Llama是从更高基线提升更少但也为正）。FT regime下Llama的正向F1效应不再存在 （RV已被FT消除，无OOV FP可移除），剩余的是纯constraint overhead。-0.30pp在 bootstrap CI下预期p~0.05-0.15，即borderline significant——可报告为\\\"mild cost\\\" 但不构成论文攻击面。\\nCF 2.0%: Llama零代码DocRED CF=12.02%（远高于Qwen 2.57%），FT大幅降低但Llama 在CF上的系统性偏高延续到FT regime。SciERC FT Llama CF=0.46%（低于Qwen 1.18%）， 但SciERC只有7个关系，DocRED 96个关系的type空间更复杂。预测2.0%——高于Qwen FT+constrained（1.5%），因Llama在DocRED semantic enforcement下的entity-type drift更明显。这与零代码的跨模型pattern一致（Llama DocRED CF始终高于Qwen）。 主要冲突模式：person↔politician, location↔country, organization↔company—— DocRED type system中语义重叠最严重的类别。\\nParse fail 2.3%→3.8%（+1.5pp）: Llama FT parse stability优于Qwen（2.3% vs 7.11%）， constrained decoding增加的overhead也更小。零代码Llama DocRED constrained parse failure从68→91（+2.3pp），FT模型输出更规范，增幅略低。3.8%仍远低于Qwen FT+constrained的9.2%——跨模型parse robustness差异是系统性的。\\n\"\n71\t  },\n72\t  {\n73\t    \"name\": \"DocRED FT Composability 2×2 Matrix Analysis (Cross-Model)\",\n74\t    \"description\": \"综合Qwen和Llama两个模型在DocRED上的2×2矩阵（base/FT × unconstrained/constrained）， 产出跨模型composability的统一分析。此分析在两个constrained eval完成后执行。\\n\",\n75\t    \"results\": {\n76\t      \"qwen_dr_ft_constrained\": 0.32,\n77\t      \"llama_dr_ft_constrained\": 0.15,\n78\t      \"qwen_r_f1_delta_ft_regime\": -0.51,\n79\t      \"llama_r_f1_delta_ft_regime\": -0.3,\n80\t      \"qwen_cf_ft_constrained\": 1.5,\n81\t      \"llama_cf_ft_constrained\": 2.0,\n82\t      \"ft_contribution_dr_reduction_pct_qwen\": 96,\n83\t      \"ft_contribution_dr_reduction_pct_llama\": 98,\n84\t      \"ontodec_residual_contribution_pct_qwen\": 58,\n85\t      \"ontodec_residual_contribution_pct_llama\": 69,\n86\t      \"total_dr_reduction_pct_qwen\": 98.3,\n87\t      \"total_dr_reduction_pct_llama\": 99.4\n88\t    },\n89\t    \"tables\": [\n90\t      {\n91\t        \"name\": \"Table: Cross-Model DocRED Composability Summary\",\n92\t        \"content\": \"| Metric               | Qwen zero-shot | Qwen FT    | Llama zero-shot | Llama FT   |\\n|----------------------|----------------|------------|-----------------|------------|\\n| DR (unconst.)        | 18.46%         | 0.76%      | 26.07%          | 0.49%      |\\n| DR (constrained)     | 10.21%         | 0.32%      | 2.55%           | 0.15%      |\\n| DR Δ (const-unconst) | -8.25pp        | -0.44pp    | -23.52pp        | -0.34pp    |\\n| R-F1 (unconst.)      | 7.74           | 40.86      | 5.98            | 43.72      |\\n| R-F1 (constrained)   | 8.23           | 40.35      | 6.27            | 43.42      |\\n| R-F1 Δ               | +0.49pp        | -0.51pp    | +0.29pp         | -0.30pp    |\\n| CF (constrained)     | 2.57%          | 1.50%      | 12.02%          | 2.00%      |\\n\"\n93\t      },\n94\t      {\n95\t        \"name\": \"Table: DR Attribution — FT vs OntoCoDec Contribution\",\n96\t        \"content\": \"| Model | Baseline DR | After FT | After FT+OntoCoDec | FT contrib. | OntoCoDec contrib. |\\n|-------|------------|----------|--------------------|-------------|-------------------|\\n| Qwen  | 18.46%     | 0.76%    | 0.32%              | ↓95.9%      | ↓57.9% of residual |\\n| Llama | 26.07%     | 0.49%    | 0.15%              | ↓98.1%      | ↓69.4% of residual |\\n\"\n97\t      }\n98\t    ],\n99\t    \"figures\": [],\n100\t    \"analysis\": \"Median tier下的论文叙事调整：\\n1. Abstract: \\\"zero F1 cost\\\" → \\\"negligible F1 cost (≤0.5pp) in the fine-tuned\\n   regime, with zero cost confirmed in zero-shot settings\\\"\\n\\n2. §5.4 FT Composability: 核心message是\\\"OntoCoDec composes with FT at minimal\\n   cost, providing guaranteed DR<0.5% that FT alone cannot achieve.\\\" 报告具体的\\n   R-F1 cost（-0.3 to -0.5pp）和DR benefit（additional 58-69% reduction of\\n   FT residual）。Acknowledge这是composability tax，但对比post-hoc filtering\\n   的recall loss（-1.06pp DocRED）和information loss（48.1% triples rejected），\\n   OntoCoDec的trade-off更favorable。\\n\\n3. CF discussion: FT+OntoCoDec CF（1.5-2.0%）远低于零代码+OntoCoDec CF\\n   （2.57-12.02%），这是positive finding。在§7 Limitations中保留CF作为\\n   inherent limitation，但补充\\\"FT substantially mitigates CF (88% reduction\\n   on SciERC, 42-83% on DocRED)\\\"。\\n\\n4. 投稿策略: Median tier下论文仍targets Accept——核心贡献（violation landscape\\n   + method + zero-shot results）不受影响，FT composability section变为\\\"§5.4\\n   analysis showing method robustness under different training regimes\\\"而非\\n   headline claim。总体预期评分3.5-4.0，主要风险从FT composability转移回CF\\n   trade-off和novelty perception。\\n\\n\\n2×2矩阵的核心insight是FT和OntoCoDec在DR reduction pipeline中占据不同阶段： FT负责bulk reduction（18-26%→0.5-0.8%，↓96-98%），OntoCoDec负责residual guarantee（0.5-0.8%→0.15-0.32%，再↓58-69%）。两阶段组合实现98-99%总DR消除。\\n在median tier下，composability的代价是非零的：R-F1损失0.3-0.5pp，CF增加 1.5-2.0pp。这些代价在SciERC FT regime几乎不存在（R-F1 ±0.1pp, CF 0.5-1.2%）， 差异归因于DocRED ontology complexity（τ̄=0.842 vs 0.333）。\\n关键发现：FT+OntoCoDec对CF的影响远小于零代码+OntoCoDec——SciERC从9.90%降至 1.18%（Qwen）/ 0.46%（Llama），DocRED预期从2.57%到1.5%（Qwen）/ 12.02%到 2.0%（Llama）。FT通过内化entity type conventions大幅减少entity-vs-relation type drift。这支持\\\"FT resolves the CF trade-off that is the primary limitation in zero-shot deployment\\\"的framing——CF不再是Limitation #1，而是已被FT缓解的 secondary concern。\\n\"\n101\t  },\n102\t  {\n103\t    \"name\": \"Bootstrap CI for DocRED FT Composability\",\n104\t    \"description\": \"对两个模型的DocRED FT+constrained vs FT+unconstrained进行bootstrap CI（10000 iterations），验证R-F1 delta的统计显著性。\\n\",\n105\t    \"results\": {\n106\t      \"qwen_r_f1_delta_pp\": -0.51,\n107\t      \"qwen_r_f1_95ci_lower\": -0.95,\n108\t      \"qwen_r_f1_95ci_upper\": -0.08,\n109\t      \"qwen_p_value\": 0.04,\n110\t      \"qwen_significance\": \"marginal (p<0.05 but CI wide)\",\n111\t      \"llama_r_f1_delta_pp\": -0.3,\n112\t      \"llama_r_f1_95ci_lower\": -0.72,\n113\t      \"llama_r_f1_95ci_upper\": 0.1,\n114\t      \"llama_p_value\": 0.11,\n115\t      \"llama_significance\": \"not significant (CI crosses zero)\",\n116\t      \"qwen_e_f1_delta_pp\": -0.25,\n117\t      \"qwen_e_f1_p_value\": 0.15,\n118\t      \"llama_e_f1_delta_pp\": -0.38,\n119\t      \"llama_e_f1_p_value\": 0.08\n120\t    },\n121\t    \"tables\": [\n122\t      {\n123\t        \"name\": \"Table: Bootstrap CI for FT Composability on DocRED\",\n124\t        \"content\": \"| Model | Metric | Δpp   | 95% CI          | p-value | Significant? |\\n|-------|--------|-------|-----------------|---------|--------------|\\n| Qwen  | R-F1   | -0.51 | [-0.95, -0.08]  | 0.04    | marginal     |\\n| Qwen  | E-F1   | -0.25 | [-0.62, +0.11]  | 0.15    | no           |\\n| Llama | R-F1   | -0.30 | [-0.72, +0.10]  | 0.11    | no           |\\n| Llama | E-F1   | -0.38 | [-0.80, +0.05]  | 0.08    | no           |\\n\"\n125\t      }\n126\t    ],\n127\t    \"figures\": [],\n128\t    \"analysis\": \"Bootstrap CI在median tier下提供nuanced evidence：FT+constrained在DocRED上的 F1 cost是real but small, 且model-dependent。最强的论文framing是\\\"FT composability at negligible cost\\\"而非\\\"zero cost\\\"——Qwen的marginal significance（p=0.04） 防止overclaim，Llama的non-significance（p=0.11）提供positive counterpoint。 与零代码DocRED的highly significant positive effect（R-F1 +0.50pp, p<0.001） 形成对比：零代码regime有headroom for OOV elimination gains，FT regime没有。\\n\\nBootstrap CI在median tier下的预期pattern：\\nQwen R-F1 -0.51pp: DocRED有998个文档，FT模型每文档~16-17 triples，给予足够 统计功效检测0.5pp级别的差异。预期p~0.04（marginal significant），95% CI [-0.95, -0.08]——不跨零但upper bound接近零。这意味着差异是real的但small。 论文可报告为\\\"statistically detectable but practically negligible\\\"。\\nLlama R-F1 -0.30pp: 更小的effect size + Llama更高的parse failure（降低有效 样本量）→ 预期p~0.11（not significant）。CI [-0.72, +0.10]跨零。这实际上 是positive outcome——无法拒绝\\\"Llama FT+constrained R-F1 ≈ FT unconstrained\\\" 的零假设，支持\\\"negligible cost\\\" framing。\\nE-F1的delta更小（-0.25, -0.38pp），在E-F1的基数（82-84%）下effect size更小， 预期均not significant——constrained decoding对entity extraction的影响在FT regime下可忽略。\\n论文reporting策略：只需报告R-F1的bootstrap CI。如果Qwen marginal significant 而Llama not significant，frame为\\\"R-F1 cost is model-dependent: Qwen shows a small but detectable -0.5pp decline (p=0.04), while Llama shows no significant change (-0.3pp, p=0.11)\\\"。这比uniform \\\"no cost\\\" claim更honest也更robust。\\n\"\n129\t  }\n130\t]"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5d4a565a-e013-402f-8e45-87181b11ef06","uuid":"abd41237-d34f-4606-b984-8e9591722602","timestamp":"2026-05-16T02:33:20.301Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_6/projects/schema_semantic_constrained_ie/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260516T021434/median/experiment_data.json","content":"[\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Qwen DocRED FT + OntoCoDec constrained eval\",\n    \"description\": \"Full S1 constrained decoding (grammar+semantic) on Qwen3-8B fine-tuned with LoRA on DocRED training set. Completes the 2×2 composability matrix (base/FT × unconstrained/constrained) for Qwen on DocRED. Baseline: FT unconstrained DR=0.76%, RV=0.27%, ET=0%, CF=0.12%, R-F1=40.86%, E-F1=82.15%, parse_fail=7.11%.\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"DR_pct\": 0.32,\n      \"RV_pct\": 0.0,\n      \"ET_pct\": 0.0,\n      \"CF_pct\": 1.5,\n      \"R_F1\": 40.35,\n      \"R_precision\": 36.05,\n      \"R_recall\": 45.8,\n      \"E_F1\": 81.9,\n      \"E_precision\": 85.2,\n      \"E_recall\": 78.85,\n      \"parse_fail_rate_pct\": 9.2,\n      \"total_entities_pred\": \"~18050\",\n      \"total_relations_pred\": \"~15800\",\n      \"R_F1_delta_pp\": -0.51,\n      \"E_F1_delta_pp\": -0.25,\n      \"DR_reduction_from_ft_unconstrained_pct\": -57.9,\n      \"CF_increase_from_ft_unconstrained_pp\": 1.38\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Qwen DocRED 2×2 Composability Matrix\",\n        \"content\": \"| Config              | DR%   | RV%   | ET%  | CF%   | R-F1   | E-F1   |\\n|---------------------|-------|-------|------|-------|--------|--------|\\n| Zero-shot unconst.  | 18.46 | 29.66 | 2.48 | 0.10  |  7.74  | 58.15  |\\n| Zero-shot full_s1   | 10.21 |  0.03 | 0.00 | 2.57  |  8.23  | 59.37  |\\n| FT unconstrained    |  0.76 |  0.27 | 0.00 | 0.12  | 40.86  | 82.15  |\\n| FT full_s1          |  0.32 |  0.00 | 0.00 | 1.50  | 40.35  | 81.90  |\\n\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Qwen DocRED FT+constrained per-relation DR (top violators)\",\n        \"content\": \"| Relation                   | τ     | FT-unconst DR% | FT-const DR% | Δ       |\\n|----------------------------|-------|----------------|--------------|---------|\\n| P31_instance_of            | 0.98  | 1.8            | 0.9          | -0.9pp  |\\n| P1001_applies_to_jurisd.   | 0.95  | 1.2            | 0.4          | -0.8pp  |\\n| P710_participant           | 0.92  | 0.5            | 0.1          | -0.4pp  |\\n| Used-for (大部分)           | <0.5  | 0.0            | 0.0          | 0       |\\n\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Qwen DocRED FT+constrained结果在median tier下支持calibrated composability claim： FT is the primary mechanism (DR↓96%), OntoCoDec provides marginal but real additional reduction (0.76→0.32, ↓58%). R-F1 cost -0.51pp is the price of this guarantee, acceptable for compliance-critical applications. 与SciERC FT+constrained（DR=0%, R-F1=-0.09pp）的差距归因于ontology complexity: DocRED τ̄=0.842导致高fallback率， SciERC τ̄=0.333几乎不触发fallback。这不是方法局限而是可量化的tightness效应—— paper §5.4应报告fallback率差异作为解释。CF 1.5%与SciERC FT（1.18%）同量级， 确认FT大幅缓解CF问题（vs零代码CF=2.57%）。\\n论文framing调整：§5.4从\\\"FT+OntoCoDec = zero cost\\\"改为\\\"FT+OntoCoDec = negligible cost (R-F1 -0.5pp) with guaranteed DR reduction below 0.5%\\\"。Abstract中\\\"zero F1 cost\\\" 改为\\\"negligible F1 cost in the FT regime\\\"。\\n\\n\\nDR 0.76%→0.32%: FT已将DR从18.46%削减至0.76%（↓96%），残余主要集中在tight-constraint 关系（如P31_instance_of τ=0.98, P1001_applies_to_jurisdiction τ=0.95）。OntoCoDec semantic层可进一步消除部分残余，但DocRED τ̄=0.842导致大量token位置触发 grammar-first fallback（零代码DocRED full_s1约57次/doc）。FT模型fallback频率略低 （模型输出更规范，减少空集交集），但仍显著高于SciERC。残余0.32%来自：(1) fallback 退化到grammar-only的token位置上，模型生成了合法关系名但违规的domain/range组合； (2) FT模型在极少数tight-constraint关系上的latent DR violation（FT学到了常见pattern 但未完全覆盖罕见的合法entity-type对）。相比SciERC FT+constrained的DR=0.0%（Qwen）， DocRED的非零残余反映了ontology complexity对constraint coverage的系统性影响。\\nRV/ET→0%: Grammar层确保——与FT无关，和零代码行为一致。\\nR-F1 40.86→40.35（-0.51pp）: FT模型RV baseline仅0.27%（vs零代码29.66%），grammar层 几乎无precision提升空间（零代码时grammar消除OOV FP是F1提升的唯一来源）。同时semantic 层的logit masking在well-calibrated模型上产生轻微质量损失：FT模型的type assignment已高度 准确，semantic mask偶尔会阻止模型的正确首选token，迫使其选择次优但合法的替代——这在 SciERC上影响极小（-0.09pp），但DocRED 96个关系×高tightness意味着更多masking事件累积 为可测量的F1下降。Recall略降（constraint偶尔导致relation slot生成次优triple）， precision略降（少量新引入的CF violation对应的triple被checker计为violation但all_set 评测仍计入FP）。-0.51pp在统计上可能仅marginal significant（bootstrap p~0.03-0.08）， 是\\\"可接受的composability税\\\"而非方法缺陷。\\nCF 0.12%→1.5%: Semantic层引入entity-vs-relation type drift（与零代码机制相同）， 但FT模型已内化entity type conventions，CF远低于零代码（零代码Qwen DocRED CF=2.57%）。 SciERC FT CF=1.18%是参考锚点；DocRED因96关系×高tightness导致更多semantic enforcement 事件，CF略高于SciERC FT但远低于零代码。主要冲突模式预测：location↔country, organization↔political_party等DocRED type system边界模糊区。\\nParse fail 7.11%→9.2%（+2.1pp）: Qwen FT在DocRED上unconstrained已有较高parse failure （7.11%, 71/998 samples）。Constrained decoding的grammar enforcement在长文档上增加 generation复杂度，导致部分样本超时或生成中断。增幅与零代码（12/998→11/998，几乎不变） 不同，因为FT模型生成更长、更详细的输出（平均triple数~16-17per doc），constraint enforcement的累积overhead更大。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Llama DocRED FT + OntoCoDec constrained eval\",\n    \"description\": \"Full S1 constrained decoding (grammar+semantic) on Llama-3.1-8B fine-tuned with LoRA on DocRED training set. Completes the 2×2 composability matrix for Llama on DocRED. Baseline: FT unconstrained DR=0.49%, RV=0.15%, ET=0%, R-F1=43.72%, E-F1=83.93%, parse_fail=2.3%.\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"DR_pct\": 0.15,\n      \"RV_pct\": 0.0,\n      \"ET_pct\": 0.0,\n      \"CF_pct\": 2.0,\n      \"R_F1\": 43.42,\n      \"R_precision\": 38.4,\n      \"R_recall\": 50.1,\n      \"E_F1\": 83.55,\n      \"E_precision\": 84.6,\n      \"E_recall\": 82.52,\n      \"parse_fail_rate_pct\": 3.8,\n      \"total_entities_pred\": \"~19050\",\n      \"total_relations_pred\": \"~16100\",\n      \"R_F1_delta_pp\": -0.3,\n      \"E_F1_delta_pp\": -0.38,\n      \"DR_reduction_from_ft_unconstrained_pct\": -69.4,\n      \"CF_increase_from_ft_unconstrained_pp\": \"~2.0\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Llama DocRED 2×2 Composability Matrix\",\n        \"content\": \"| Config              | DR%   | RV%   | ET%  | CF%   | R-F1   | E-F1   |\\n|---------------------|-------|-------|------|-------|--------|--------|\\n| Zero-shot unconst.  | 26.07 | 16.03 | 0.13 | 0.17  |  5.98  | 55.65  |\\n| Zero-shot full_s1   |  2.55 |  0.00 | 0.00 | 12.02 |  6.27  | 55.01  |\\n| FT unconstrained    |  0.49 |  0.15 | 0.00 | ~0    | 43.72  | 83.93  |\\n| FT full_s1          |  0.15 |  0.00 | 0.00 | 2.00  | 43.42  | 83.55  |\\n\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Llama DocRED FT+constrained per-relation DR (top violators)\",\n        \"content\": \"| Relation                   | τ     | FT-unconst DR% | FT-const DR% | Δ       |\\n|----------------------------|-------|----------------|--------------|---------|\\n| P31_instance_of            | 0.98  | 1.0            | 0.3          | -0.7pp  |\\n| P1001_applies_to_jurisd.   | 0.95  | 0.6            | 0.1          | -0.5pp  |\\n| Others (τ<0.9)             | <0.9  | ~0.0           | 0.0          | 0       |\\n\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Llama DocRED FT+constrained在median tier下表现略优于Qwen：DR更低（0.15% vs 0.32%）， R-F1损失更小（-0.30pp vs -0.51pp），parse failure更低（3.8% vs 9.2%）。但CF更高 （2.0% vs 1.5%），延续了Llama在DocRED上CF偏高的系统性pattern。\\n跨模型composability claim在median tier下仍然成立但需要nuance：两个模型都实现了 DR<0.5%（远低于零代码的10-26%），R-F1代价均<1pp，确认FT+OntoCoDec是robust的 composable pipeline。但R-F1不再是\\\"zero cost\\\"——需要修改为\\\"minimal cost\\\"。\\n\\n\\nDR 0.49%→0.15%: Llama FT baseline DR已极低（0.49%），低于Qwen FT（0.76%）。 两个因素解释Llama更低的残余：(1) Llama在DocRED上zero-shot RV baseline较低 （16.03% vs Qwen 29.66%），FT后RV更接近零（0.15%），grammar层处理更少OOV→ semantic层获得更干净的输入→更少fallback事件；(2) Llama FT在SciERC上constrained DR=0.09%（vs Qwen 0.0%），显示两模型在低DR区间差异微小。DocRED残余0.15%来自 极少数high-tightness关系（P31 τ=0.98等），这些关系的constraint空间极窄，FT 无法完全学习所有合法pair，OntoCoDec在fallback区域也无法覆盖。\\nR-F1 43.72→43.42（-0.30pp）: Llama在SciERC FT+constrained上实现+0.02pp（中性）， 但DocRED的高tightness增加constraint overhead。-0.30pp比Qwen（-0.51pp）更小， 与两模型在零代码上的pattern一致：Llama对constraint decoding更robust（零代码 DocRED R-F1 Llama +0.29pp vs Qwen +0.50pp，注意Qwen实际是从更低基线提升更多， 而Llama是从更高基线提升更少但也为正）。FT regime下Llama的正向F1效应不再存在 （RV已被FT消除，无OOV FP可移除），剩余的是纯constraint overhead。-0.30pp在 bootstrap CI下预期p~0.05-0.15，即borderline significant——可报告为\\\"mild cost\\\" 但不构成论文攻击面。\\nCF 2.0%: Llama零代码DocRED CF=12.02%（远高于Qwen 2.57%），FT大幅降低但Llama 在CF上的系统性偏高延续到FT regime。SciERC FT Llama CF=0.46%（低于Qwen 1.18%）， 但SciERC只有7个关系，DocRED 96个关系的type空间更复杂。预测2.0%——高于Qwen FT+constrained（1.5%），因Llama在DocRED semantic enforcement下的entity-type drift更明显。这与零代码的跨模型pattern一致（Llama DocRED CF始终高于Qwen）。 主要冲突模式：person↔politician, location↔country, organization↔company—— DocRED type system中语义重叠最严重的类别。\\nParse fail 2.3%→3.8%（+1.5pp）: Llama FT parse stability优于Qwen（2.3% vs 7.11%）， constrained decoding增加的overhead也更小。零代码Llama DocRED constrained parse failure从68→91（+2.3pp），FT模型输出更规范，增幅略低。3.8%仍远低于Qwen FT+constrained的9.2%——跨模型parse robustness差异是系统性的。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"DocRED FT Composability 2×2 Matrix Analysis (Cross-Model)\",\n    \"description\": \"综合Qwen和Llama两个模型在DocRED上的2×2矩阵（base/FT × unconstrained/constrained）， 产出跨模型composability的统一分析。此分析在两个constrained eval完成后执行。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"qwen_dr_ft_constrained\": 0.32,\n      \"llama_dr_ft_constrained\": 0.15,\n      \"qwen_r_f1_delta_ft_regime\": -0.51,\n      \"llama_r_f1_delta_ft_regime\": -0.3,\n      \"qwen_cf_ft_constrained\": 1.5,\n      \"llama_cf_ft_constrained\": 2.0,\n      \"ft_contribution_dr_reduction_pct_qwen\": 96,\n      \"ft_contribution_dr_reduction_pct_llama\": 98,\n      \"ontodec_residual_contribution_pct_qwen\": 58,\n      \"ontodec_residual_contribution_pct_llama\": 69,\n      \"total_dr_reduction_pct_qwen\": 98.3,\n      \"total_dr_reduction_pct_llama\": 99.4\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Cross-Model DocRED Composability Summary\",\n        \"content\": \"| Metric               | Qwen zero-shot | Qwen FT    | Llama zero-shot | Llama FT   |\\n|----------------------|----------------|------------|-----------------|------------|\\n| DR (unconst.)        | 18.46%         | 0.76%      | 26.07%          | 0.49%      |\\n| DR (constrained)     | 10.21%         | 0.32%      | 2.55%           | 0.15%      |\\n| DR Δ (const-unconst) | -8.25pp        | -0.44pp    | -23.52pp        | -0.34pp    |\\n| R-F1 (unconst.)      | 7.74           | 40.86      | 5.98            | 43.72      |\\n| R-F1 (constrained)   | 8.23           | 40.35      | 6.27            | 43.42      |\\n| R-F1 Δ               | +0.49pp        | -0.51pp    | +0.29pp         | -0.30pp    |\\n| CF (constrained)     | 2.57%          | 1.50%      | 12.02%          | 2.00%      |\\n\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: DR Attribution — FT vs OntoCoDec Contribution\",\n        \"content\": \"| Model | Baseline DR | After FT | After FT+OntoCoDec | FT contrib. | OntoCoDec contrib. |\\n|-------|------------|----------|--------------------|-------------|-------------------|\\n| Qwen  | 18.46%     | 0.76%    | 0.32%              | ↓95.9%      | ↓57.9% of residual |\\n| Llama | 26.07%     | 0.49%    | 0.15%              | ↓98.1%      | ↓69.4% of residual |\\n\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Median tier下的论文叙事调整：\\n1. Abstract: \\\"zero F1 cost\\\" → \\\"negligible F1 cost (≤0.5pp) in the fine-tuned\\n   regime, with zero cost confirmed in zero-shot settings\\\"\\n\\n2. §5.4 FT Composability: 核心message是\\\"OntoCoDec composes with FT at minimal\\n   cost, providing guaranteed DR<0.5% that FT alone cannot achieve.\\\" 报告具体的\\n   R-F1 cost（-0.3 to -0.5pp）和DR benefit（additional 58-69% reduction of\\n   FT residual）。Acknowledge这是composability tax，但对比post-hoc filtering\\n   的recall loss（-1.06pp DocRED）和information loss（48.1% triples rejected），\\n   OntoCoDec的trade-off更favorable。\\n\\n3. CF discussion: FT+OntoCoDec CF（1.5-2.0%）远低于零代码+OntoCoDec CF\\n   （2.57-12.02%），这是positive finding。在§7 Limitations中保留CF作为\\n   inherent limitation，但补充\\\"FT substantially mitigates CF (88% reduction\\n   on SciERC, 42-83% on DocRED)\\\"。\\n\\n4. 投稿策略: Median tier下论文仍targets Accept——核心贡献（violation landscape\\n   + method + zero-shot results）不受影响，FT composability section变为\\\"§5.4\\n   analysis showing method robustness under different training regimes\\\"而非\\n   headline claim。总体预期评分3.5-4.0，主要风险从FT composability转移回CF\\n   trade-off和novelty perception。\\n\\n\\n2×2矩阵的核心insight是FT和OntoCoDec在DR reduction pipeline中占据不同阶段： FT负责bulk reduction（18-26%→0.5-0.8%，↓96-98%），OntoCoDec负责residual guarantee（0.5-0.8%→0.15-0.32%，再↓58-69%）。两阶段组合实现98-99%总DR消除。\\n在median tier下，composability的代价是非零的：R-F1损失0.3-0.5pp，CF增加 1.5-2.0pp。这些代价在SciERC FT regime几乎不存在（R-F1 ±0.1pp, CF 0.5-1.2%）， 差异归因于DocRED ontology complexity（τ̄=0.842 vs 0.333）。\\n关键发现：FT+OntoCoDec对CF的影响远小于零代码+OntoCoDec——SciERC从9.90%降至 1.18%（Qwen）/ 0.46%（Llama），DocRED预期从2.57%到1.5%（Qwen）/ 12.02%到 2.0%（Llama）。FT通过内化entity type conventions大幅减少entity-vs-relation type drift。这支持\\\"FT resolves the CF trade-off that is the primary limitation in zero-shot deployment\\\"的framing——CF不再是Limitation #1，而是已被FT缓解的 secondary concern。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Bootstrap CI for DocRED FT Composability\",\n    \"description\": \"对两个模型的DocRED FT+constrained vs FT+unconstrained进行bootstrap CI（10000 iterations），验证R-F1 delta的统计显著性。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"qwen_r_f1_delta_pp\": -0.51,\n      \"qwen_r_f1_95ci_lower\": -0.95,\n      \"qwen_r_f1_95ci_upper\": -0.08,\n      \"qwen_p_value\": 0.04,\n      \"qwen_significance\": \"marginal (p<0.05 but CI wide)\",\n      \"llama_r_f1_delta_pp\": -0.3,\n      \"llama_r_f1_95ci_lower\": -0.72,\n      \"llama_r_f1_95ci_upper\": 0.1,\n      \"llama_p_value\": 0.11,\n      \"llama_significance\": \"not significant (CI crosses zero)\",\n      \"qwen_e_f1_delta_pp\": -0.25,\n      \"qwen_e_f1_p_value\": 0.15,\n      \"llama_e_f1_delta_pp\": -0.38,\n      \"llama_e_f1_p_value\": 0.08\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Bootstrap CI for FT Composability on DocRED\",\n        \"content\": \"| Model | Metric | Δpp   | 95% CI          | p-value | Significant? |\\n|-------|--------|-------|-----------------|---------|--------------|\\n| Qwen  | R-F1   | -0.51 | [-0.95, -0.08]  | 0.04    | marginal     |\\n| Qwen  | E-F1   | -0.25 | [-0.62, +0.11]  | 0.15    | no           |\\n| Llama | R-F1   | -0.30 | [-0.72, +0.10]  | 0.11    | no           |\\n| Llama | E-F1   | -0.38 | [-0.80, +0.05]  | 0.08    | no           |\\n\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Bootstrap CI在median tier下提供nuanced evidence：FT+constrained在DocRED上的 F1 cost是real but small, 且model-dependent。最强的论文framing是\\\"FT composability at negligible cost\\\"而非\\\"zero cost\\\"——Qwen的marginal significance（p=0.04） 防止overclaim，Llama的non-significance（p=0.11）提供positive counterpoint。 与零代码DocRED的highly significant positive effect（R-F1 +0.50pp, p<0.001） 形成对比：零代码regime有headroom for OOV elimination gains，FT regime没有。\\n\\nBootstrap CI在median tier下的预期pattern：\\nQwen R-F1 -0.51pp: DocRED有998个文档，FT模型每文档~16-17 triples，给予足够 统计功效检测0.5pp级别的差异。预期p~0.04（marginal significant），95% CI [-0.95, -0.08]——不跨零但upper bound接近零。这意味着差异是real的但small。 论文可报告为\\\"statistically detectable but practically negligible\\\"。\\nLlama R-F1 -0.30pp: 更小的effect size + Llama更高的parse failure（降低有效 样本量）→ 预期p~0.11（not significant）。CI [-0.72, +0.10]跨零。这实际上 是positive outcome——无法拒绝\\\"Llama FT+constrained R-F1 ≈ FT unconstrained\\\" 的零假设，支持\\\"negligible cost\\\" framing。\\nE-F1的delta更小（-0.25, -0.38pp），在E-F1的基数（82-84%）下effect size更小， 预期均not significant——constrained decoding对entity extraction的影响在FT regime下可忽略。\\n论文reporting策略：只需报告R-F1的bootstrap CI。如果Qwen marginal significant 而Llama not significant，frame为\\\"R-F1 cost is model-dependent: Qwen shows a small but detectable -0.5pp decline (p=0.04), while Llama shows no significant change (-0.3pp, p=0.11)\\\"。这比uniform \\\"no cost\\\" claim更honest也更robust。\\n\"\n  }\n]","numLines":130,"startLine":1,"totalLines":130}}}
